# #5837, a5e2e2ef's ruling on the split-cost cuts (P1-P4, L1-L3). It edits an operator,
# not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestResolveAtAdmittedGeneration
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the donor's deferred bound resolves at the generation its writes were admitted under, so a receiver arm resolves it before the link's raise and a stale donor write is admitted after the resolved head (L2)
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
ResolveAbove(g) == g + 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: at the admitted generation.
ResolveAbove(g) == g
--- END
